I wouldn't say it's more powerful than Vorpy.  There are many fewer
non-headed monsters than there are poison resistant monsters (&, L)
that you might care about.  It also has the same alignment issues that
normal ones do (lawfuls and samurai).

I don't think it should be toned down.  For the quests, I can't
remember the last quest I did without a wand of death (maybe my
