monster (this is the best case), I think you're already dead on your
feet.  For the early game, I would argue that it's no /more/ powerful
than Vorpal Blade.  Certainly being an orcish dagger versus a long
sword will make it do much less damage in general.

So, I think it's a fair (and thematic) addition to the chaotic
artifacts.  That's just my opinion, though.  =)

